flowchart LR
    Start([Start]) --> SelectClass[Teacher selects assigned class]
    SelectClass --> OpenLobby[Teacher opens session lobby]
    OpenLobby --> IssueCode[Runtime issues QR and six-digit code]
    IssueCode --> ChildRequest[Child submits join request]
    ChildRequest --> Valid{Lobby open and request valid?}
    Valid -->|Yes| Pending[Create pending request]
    Valid -->|No| Reject[Generic rejection; persistent source-IP limit]
    Pending --> Review[Teacher reviews roster, profile and consent]
    Review --> Admit{Teacher admits?}
    Admit -->|Yes| Grant[Create scoped admitted grant]
    Admit -->|No| Denied[Mark request denied]
    Grant --> StartNow{Teacher starts session now?}
    Denied --> StartNow
    StartNow -->|No| KeepLobby[Keep lobby open]
    Pending -. still pending at Start .-> AtomicStart[Close new admission; revoke pending requests]
    StartNow -->|Yes| AtomicStart
    AtomicStart --> Preserve[Keep already-admitted grants]
    Preserve --> Active[Session active]
    Active --> LateJoin[Reject new joins after Start]
